Day 45 of the Claude Code Challenge :  Build an AI Decision Strategist 



Today, I explored how Claude AI can transform decision-making from intuition-driven to data-driven, structured, and objective.



Here's what I learned:

1 Build an interactive AI-powered Decision Report

2 Generate a Decision Matrix with weighted scoring

3 Compare multiple options objectively using AI

4 Identify cognitive biases and hidden assumptions before deciding

5 Run a Premortem Analysis to anticipate what could go wrong

6 Create a 7-Day Decision Experiment Plan to validate assumptions

7 Receive an AI-powered verdict backed by logic and reasoning

8 Export a professional HTML Decision Dashboard for easy sharing

This approach can be applied to:

📈 Business strategy

💼 Career decisions

🚀 Startup planning

💰 Investment choices

🌱 Personal growth and life decisions





As leaders, the quality of our decisions determines the quality of our outcomes. AI is becoming a powerful thinking partner, helping us make smarter choices with greater confidence.



